@startuml 04_deployment_diagram
title FairCreditScore — Deployment Topology (Heroku)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #1565C0
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #FCE4EC
  BorderColor #C62828
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor #EDE7F6
  BorderColor #4527A0
}

cloud "Internet" as Internet

node "Client" {
  artifact "Browser\n(desktop / mobile)" as Browser
  artifact "Lender\nAPI client" as ApiClient
}

node "Heroku Router" as Router {
  artifact "TLS termination\n(HTTPS:443)" as TLS
  artifact "X-Forwarded-Proto: https" as XFP
}

node "Heroku Dyno (web)" as Dyno {
  artifact "gunicorn\nworker" as GUni
  artifact "Django app\n(faircredit + core)" as App
  artifact "WhiteNoise\ncompressed manifest" as WhiteN
}

node "Heroku release phase" as ReleaseDyno {
  artifact "python manage.py migrate" as Mig
}

database "Heroku Postgres\n(SSL)" as PG

node "Object storage (planned for prod)" as S3 {
  artifact "media/documents/\nuploaded PDFs" as MediaProd
}

Browser   --> Internet : HTTPS:443
ApiClient --> Internet : HTTPS:443
Internet --> TLS
TLS --> GUni : HTTP:5000\n+ X-Forwarded-Proto
GUni --> App
App --> WhiteN : /static/*
App --> PG : TCP:5432\n(SSL)
App --> MediaProd : (S3 in prod;\nlocal /media/ in dev)
ReleaseDyno --> PG : migrate

note right of App
  ENV vars (Heroku config):
  - DJANGO_SECRET_KEY
  - DJANGO_DEBUG=0
  - DJANGO_ALLOWED_HOSTS
  - DJANGO_CSRF_TRUSTED_ORIGINS
  - DATABASE_URL  (auto-set by addon)
end note

note bottom of Browser
  Dev setup:
    runserver 8000 + SQLite at db.sqlite3
    + local /media/ on disk
    + WhiteNoise serving /static/ from staticfiles/
end note

@enduml
